# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for local development. Wrangler loads it automatically.
# Nothing here is required for Milestone 00; the mock providers need no credentials.
# Non-secret settings live in wrangler.jsonc `vars`; put only secrets and local overrides here.

# Local override examples:
# LOG_LEVEL=debug
# APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# Secrets for real providers (later milestones). Never commit real values.
# EMAIL_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=
